===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|es|la|lapis||stone}} (whence English {{m|en|lapidary}} and {{m|en|lapis lazuli}}), or through {{der|es|it|lapis}}<ref>https://www.scribd.com/document/158436236/Diccionario-Critico-Etimologico-castellano-G-MA-Corominas-Joan-pdf</ref>; compare also {{cog|pt|lápis}}. {{doublet|es|lápida}}.

